.gocache/

# Output of scripts/mailgun-audit.sh: an inventory of production domains,
# SMTP logins and requestor addresses. This repo is public.
audit/

# Contributor-facing agent guidance is tracked, overriding a global ignore of
# **/AGENTS.md. CLAUDE.md stays untracked: it is a symlink to AGENTS.md, and
# contributors use different AI tools.
!AGENTS.md
